{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cosmic Coliseum</strong> is an Action-shooter roguelite where you must fight your way to victory in a Galactic Gladiator Tournament. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158810/extras/FightToSurvive.png?t=1747350002\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158810/extras/CombatGif.gif?t=1747350002\" /></div>Choose your champion and then battle to survive wave after wave of grueling combat as The Overlords send their vicious alien hordes into the arena to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158810/extras/HeadingsChooseChampion.png?t=1747350002\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158810/extras/CosmicColiseumGuns_Characters.gif?t=1747350002\" /></div>Gather XP from your fallen enemies and level-up to gain access to a huge range of upgrades that will unlock advanced weapons and enhanced abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158810/extras/PowerUp.png?t=1747350002\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158810/extras/CosmicColiseumMetaUpgrades.gif?t=1747350002\" /></div>Defeat the Overlord Champions to access special bonus power-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choose from a range of dynamic characters, weapons and unique secondary skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Collect cash to spend at the Arena Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Destroy each Overlord Boss to unlock the next arena as you grow stronger and more experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Accumulate meta-currency with each kill and use it to purchase weapons and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Combine all of your skills and abilities as you forge a path to victory and become the <strong>Ultimate Champion</strong> of the <strong>Cosmic Coliseum.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158810/extras/CosmicColiseumShop.gif?t=1747350002\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Velox Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2158810/f68c086b7e1ac5781becad459d3f09747d80854f.jpg"},{"name":"Calidus Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2158810/f392e40ad8404ce9fef3548768ecab2df5841d0a.jpg"},{"name":"Letalis Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2158810/2ab3f904db35a5faf46cec402f026fda429f71ee.jpg"},{"name":"Fortis Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2158810/f1bc1ba37c1dc1d11b1970bce4c056826b6a7f8f.jpg"},{"name":"Plama Rifle Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2158810/4e46034d5bbf38dcf98778b57dbdf3cee0de569b.jpg"},{"name":"Quantum Disintegrator Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2158810/44292391d8d5b0b5aea884dde080bacd28180613.jpg"},{"name":"Quad-Barrel Shotgun Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2158810/55132e83592ba8b68704eca1a0a2f0658a